<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_抓握、紧捏、投掷与牵引拖拽 (Grasping, Clutching, Hurling & Dragging)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 9 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>seize<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>embrayage<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to seize</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/si:z/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɑ̃bʁɛjaʒ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('seize', 'embrayage')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 抓住, 逮捕, 俘获, 没收, 扣押, 掌握；vi. 突然抓住, 利用</td><td class='def-en'>take hold of; grab</td><td>3.8</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>get hold of</span><span class='pv-pill'>take hold of</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>prehend</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>clutch</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The sales clerk quickly seized the money on the counter”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>intercept<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>intercepter<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to intercept</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.intә'sept/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃tɛʁsɛpte/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('intercept', 'intercepter')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 拦截, 阻止, 截取</td><td class='def-en'>seize on its way</td><td>3.57</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>cut off</span><span class='pv-pill'>cut out</span><span class='pv-pill'>take hold of</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>wiretap</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>stop</span><span class='nt-pill'>tap</span><span class='nt-pill'>bug</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The fighter plane was ordered to intercept an aircraft that had entered the country's airspace”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>cuddle<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>nid<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to cuddle</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'kʌdl/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ni/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('cuddle', 'nid')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 抚抱, 抱着睡, 拥抱；vi. 依偎, 依偎着躺在一起</td><td class='def-en'>move or arrange oneself in a comfortable and cozy position</td><td>3.4</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>cling to</span><span class='pv-pill'>draw close</span><span class='pv-pill'>hold close</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>snuggle</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>nestle</span><span class='nt-pill'>nest</span><span class='nt-pill'>nuzzle</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“We cuddled against each other to keep warm”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>tweak<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>tweak<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to tweak</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/twi:k/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tweak/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('tweak', 'tweak')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 扭, 开足马力</td><td class='def-en'>pinch or squeeze sharply</td><td>3.27</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>pick off</span><span class='pv-pill'>pull off</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>pluck</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to tweak (pinch or squeeze sharply).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>snuggle<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>nid<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to snuggle</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'snʌgl/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ni/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('snuggle', 'nid')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 偎依；vt. 使舒适温暖, 紧抱</td><td class='def-en'>move or arrange oneself in a comfortable and cozy position</td><td>3.04</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>cling to</span><span class='pv-pill'>draw close</span><span class='pv-pill'>hold close</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>cuddle</span><span class='nt-pill'>nestle</span><span class='nt-pill'>nest</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“We cuddled against each other to keep warm”</div></div></td></tr>
