<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>pucker<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>chiffonner<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to pucker</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'pʌkә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʃifɔne/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('pucker', 'chiffonner')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 使起皱；vi. 折成褶</td><td class='def-en'>to gather something into small wrinkles or folds</td><td>2.52</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>scrunch up</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>crumple</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>rumple</span><span class='nt-pill'>cockle</span><span class='nt-pill'>knit</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“She puckered her lips”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>recline<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>recline<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to recline</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri'klain/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/recline/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('recline', 'recline')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 使斜靠；vi. 靠, 斜倚, 依赖</td><td class='def-en'>move the upper body backwards and down</td><td>2.51</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>fall back</span><span class='pv-pill'>lean back</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to recline (move the upper body backwards and down).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>replicate<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>rétroflexe<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to replicate</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'replikeit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/rétroflexe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('replicate', 'rétroflexe')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 折叠, 折转, 复制</td><td class='def-en'>bend or turn backward</td><td>3.55</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>retroflex</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>copy</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to replicate (bend or turn backward).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>weave<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>tisser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to weave</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/wi:v/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tise/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('weave', 'tisser')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 编织, 组合, 编排, 使迂回前进；vi. 纺织, 迂回行进</td><td class='def-en'>interlace by or as if by weaving</td><td>3.53</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>interweave</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>tissue</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to weave (interlace by or as if by weaving).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>twine<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>dentelle<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to twine</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/twain/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/dɑ̃tɛl/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('twine', 'dentelle')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 搓, (使)交织, 编饰, (使)缠绕</td><td class='def-en'>spin,wind, or twist together</td><td>2.93</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>intertwine</span><span class='fm-pill'>entwine</span><span class='fm-pill'>interlace</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>enlace</span><span class='nt-pill'>lace</span><span class='nt-pill'>wind</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“intertwine the ribbons”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>interwoven<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>tisser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to interwoven</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.intә'wәuvәn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tise/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('interwoven', 'tisser')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 互相编织</td><td class='def-en'>interlace by or as if by weaving</td><td>2.81</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>interweave</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>weave</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to interwoven (interlace by or as if by weaving).”</div></div></td></tr>
